{"id":"msg_m_ex_freezeacpu_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_freezeacpu","label":"The Citizens · Group"},"label":"2. How is everyone?","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_freezeacpu_01","next":"msg_m_ex_freezeacpu_03","speakers":{"anis":"Anis","poli":"Poli","neon":"Neon","miranda":"Miranda","rapi":"Rapi"},"icons":{"anis":"si_c012_00_s","poli":"si_c030_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","miranda":"si_c032_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"msg_m_ex_freezeacpu_02_unlock","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"text":"Unlocks: Clear event stage 103010106 · After The Citizens chat 1. Poli has invited {AccountData.NickName} to joi…","key":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_1","text":"How is everyone?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_2","text":"Everything good on your end?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_3","text":"Nothing much going on here for Poli and me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_4","text":"The food here smells amazing,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_5","text":"but Poli isn't letting me have any.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_6","text":"They're intending to sell these later.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_7","text":"You've got to at least wait until the stalls open.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_8","text":"Ugh. Fiiine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_9","text":"I had a duel with Miranda.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_10","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_11","text":"But I lost.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_12","text":"Just imagine! I, who walk the path of firepower,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_13","text":"lost to Miranda in a shooting game.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_14","text":"Ha!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_15","text":"A shooting game, you say?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_16","text":"Yeah,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_17","text":"you've got to hit different-sized pumpkins with a toy gun.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_18","text":"Since I'm a cop,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_19","text":"I know how to handle a firearm.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_20","text":"I think that may be why I won.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_21","text":"So you think I don't know how to handle a firearm?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_22","text":"How is that even possible?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_23","text":"Firepower is my life!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_24","text":"Could it have to do with the weight?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_25","text":"A toy gun is much lighter than a real weapon.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_26","text":"No, no, no.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_27","text":"A gun is a gun.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_28","text":"Firepower is firepower.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_29","text":"The gun's weight doesn't matter. There's no way I should be losing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_30","text":"How bad did you lose?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_31","text":"You didn't get pummeled, did you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_32","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_33","text":"We both missed one of the pumpkins, so we tied at 90 points each.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_34","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_35","text":"Then how come Neon is saying that she lost?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_36","text":"Because as soon as I missed a target,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_37","text":"I had already lost.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_38","text":"Uh-huh.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_39","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_40","text":"Quiry and Commander aren't reading any of these messages.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_41","text":"They must be occupied.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_42","text":"Hmm, you're right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_43","text":"Hopefully it's nothing...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_44","text":"What could possibly have happened? The event hasn't even started yet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_45","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_46","text":"Exactly...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"poli","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_47","text":"Anyway, good luck, everyone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_02_48","text":"Same to you!","jump":null}],"chat":true}